seeing to sort of shift back a little bit
to our to the earlier part of the conversation.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:42.890
Federico Finkelstein from the New School,
regularly, a fellow Argentinean, I might add.

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:49.550
He has written a lot about the analagous language
