00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:47.820
It means that it's always in remission, but
tends to emerge in different forms.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:50.710
And I think that what we have to look at is
the signals.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.130
We have to look at the similarities.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:57.550
And certainly he's absolutely right, as is
Timothy Snyder, Jason Stanley and a number

